	JMP I	.+3		/ location used to startup RXHAN
	JMP I	.+1		/ location used to return to OS8 from RXHAN
	7605			/ address of OS8 monitor
	RXLOAD			/ address of start location for RXHAN
	
	*RXLDLS			/ address within RXHAN to overlay
	RXEWT			/ write function code
	0			/ ?????? me neither
	RXQBLK			/ address of queue block to use
	.			/ address of table of disk commands

